          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th in /ci lɔa̱a̱t li̱w thi̱n, kä /ca mac bi met yieny.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi jak waŋdu ji̱ kä dui̱r lɔl ɛ, kɛ ɣöö gɔaa ni jɛn kɛ ji̱ ɛn ɣöö deri wä cieŋ kuäärä Kuɔth kɛ waŋ kɛl, kä yoru guäth maac mi thil pek kɛ wäŋ da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
